/target
Cargo.lock
embsearch-store/
*.tmp

# Model packs fetched by scripts/fetch-model.sh. Weights are tens to hundreds of
# MB and are reproducible from the script, so they do not belong in git.
#
# pack/bge-small and pack/bge-small-prefixed were committed before this rule
# existed (68 MB, the same 34 MB blob twice) and have been untracked with
# `git rm --cached`. The blobs remain in history, so this caps the damage
# rather than undoing it — .git stays ~40 MB. Purging them needs a history
# rewrite, which would break every existing clone and has not been done.
pack/

# NOTE: crates/core/models/{model.onnx,tokenizer.json} are committed as EMPTY
# placeholders so the `onnx` feature compiles. When you drop in the real
# multi-megabyte weights locally, do NOT commit them — e.g.
#   git update-index --skip-worktree crates/core/models/model.onnx
# to keep the large file out of git.
